<!--
  English, for a reader who wants the app in it.

  The mushaf itself does not translate and is not offered in translation: the
  page is drawn from the Madinah faces whichever language this is set to. What
  changes is everything around the page — the tabs, the settings, the labels on
  the running head — which is exactly what the website's own language switch
  changes and no more.
-->
